<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION PLAYOFF RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION PLAYOFF RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Dutch first</p>
<p>division play-off matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p> Emmen (II)   4  RKC Waalwijk	 5</p>
<p>Zwolle (II)  1  ADO den Haag (II)  1</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> RKC Waalwijk    6   5   0   1  19   6  15</p>
<p> Zwolle	    6   3   1   2   6   9  10</p>
<p> Emmen	     6   2   1   3   8  10   7</p>
<p> ADO Den Haag    6   0   2   4   3  11   2</p>
<p>Group winners, RKC, play in the Dutch first division next</p>
<p>season.</p>
</text>
